### C-32 — MINOR

`DisplayColorSpace` is redeclared three times inside the extract subtree over a canonical exported type two directories up. All four declarations are structurally identical BY COINCIDENCE (PickerSpace is an alias of SpaceId), so there is no compiler-visible relation between them and a narrowing of the picker's union would silently fail to propagate.

