- **Mechanism:** parallel type paths — a local declaration where a contract already exists (owner edict 2: no dual paths; edict 3: no contrivance)
- **Reproduction:** NONE — static; the divergence is latent until PickerSpace is narrowed.
- **Proposed cure:** `import type { DisplayColorSpace } from "../../color-session/color-model"` at all three sites; delete the three copies including the re-export in useImageSampler.ts.

